# Comments are stored in a Google Sheet, written to via a Google Cloud
# service account. Copy this file to .dev.vars (gitignored) and fill in
# your own values for local development.
#
# 1. Create a Google Cloud service account with the Sheets API enabled.
# 2. Create a JSON key for it and copy the "client_email" and "private_key".
# 3. Create a Google Sheet with header row: timestamp, slug, name, comment, hidden
# 4. Share the sheet with the service account's email as Editor.
# 5. Copy the sheet ID from its URL.
#
# For production, set these as Worker secrets instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PRIVATE_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put GOOGLE_SHEET_ID
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=
